sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant MC as MediaController
    participant MS as MediaService
    participant SS as StorageService
    participant MR as MediaRepository
    participant DB as MySQL (media_db)
    participant STOR as Local/S3 Storage

    Note over FE,STOR: File Upload Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/media/author/upload (multipart)
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT + AUTHOR role
    GW->>MC: Forward with X-Headers
    MC->>MS: upload(file, principal)
    MS->>SS: store(file)
    SS->>STOR: Write file to disk/S3
    STOR-->>SS: StoredFile (path, publicUrl)
    SS-->>MS: StoredFile
    MS->>MR: save(mediaFile)
    MR->>DB: INSERT INTO media_files
    MS-->>MC: MediaResponse
    MC-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>FE: Media URL

    Note over FE,STOR: Serve Public File
    FE->>GW: GET /api/media/public/files/{filename}
    GW->>MC: Forward (public path)
    MC->>MS: getFile(filename)
    MS->>SS: load(filename)
    SS->>STOR: Read file
    STOR-->>SS: File bytes
    SS-->>MS: Resource
    MS-->>MC: File content
    MC-->>GW: 200 + binary file
    GW-->>FE: Image/file data
